{"seq":2,"slug":"build-deploy-pipeline","title":"构建与部署流水线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-micro-frontends/engineering/build-deploy-pipeline","wordCount":734,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"构建与部署流水线\">构建与部署流水线</h1><p>微前端的核心价值之一是独立部署——各团队在不协调发布窗口的前提下独立上线。但「独立部署」不等于「随意部署」：版本兼容性、灰度策略、回滚机制都需要精心设计的流水线来保障。本文覆盖从仓库结构到 CDN 分发的完整工程链路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>微前端的部署拓扑与传统单体有本质区别——它是一个分布式系统的前端映射：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 独立流水线&#10;        A1[Shell CI/CD] --&gt; D1[Shell CDN]&#10;        A2[Product CI/CD] --&gt; D2[Product CDN]&#10;        A3[Order CI/CD] --&gt; D3[Order CDN]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 运行时组合&#10;        D1 --&gt; E[浏览器]&#10;        D2 --&gt; E&#10;        D3 --&gt; E&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 版本协调&#10;        F[Manifest Registry] --&gt; D1&#10;        F --&gt; D2&#10;        F --&gt; D3&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 独立流水线\n        A1[Shell CI/CD] --&gt; D1[Shell CDN]\n        A2[Product CI/CD] --&gt; D2[Product CDN]\n        A3[Order CI/CD] --&gt; D3[Order CDN]\n    end\n    subgraph 运行时组合\n        D1 --&gt; E[浏览器]\n        D2 --&gt; E\n        D3 --&gt; E\n    end\n    subgraph 版本协调\n        F[Manifest Registry] --&gt; D1\n        F --&gt; D2\n        F --&gt; D3\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"仓库策略选择\">仓库策略选择</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>结构</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Polyrepo</td>\n<td>每个子应用独立仓库</td>\n<td>完全独立，权限隔离</td>\n<td>共享代码困难，版本漂移</td>\n<td>跨组织协作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Monorepo</td>\n<td>单仓库多包</td>\n<td>原子提交，依赖统一</td>\n<td>CI 复杂度高，权限粗粒度</td>\n<td>同组织多团队</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合模式</td>\n<td>Shell + 共享库 monorepo，子应用 polyrepo</td>\n<td>平衡独立性与共享</td>\n<td>维护两套 CI</td>\n<td>大型组织</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>2026 年的实践共识：<strong>优先 monorepo（pnpm workspace + Turborepo），当组织规模达到真实的权限隔离需求时才拆为 polyrepo</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"构建流水线设计\">构建流水线设计</h2><h3 id=\"独立构建原则\">独立构建原则</h3><p>每个子应用必须能够<strong>独立构建</strong>——不依赖其他子应用的构建产物：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# .github/workflows/product-app.yml&#10;name: Product App CI&#10;on:&#10;  push:&#10;    paths: [&#39;apps/product/**&#39;, &#39;packages/shared/**&#39;]&#10;jobs:&#10;  build:&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v4&#10;      - run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile&#10;      - run: pnpm --filter @app/product build&#10;      - run: pnpm --filter @app/product test&#10;      - uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          name: product-dist&#10;          path: apps/product/dist/\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .github/workflows/product-app.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Product App CI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    paths</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'apps/product/**'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'packages/shared/**'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  build</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm/action-setup@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm install --frozen-lockfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm --filter @app/product build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm --filter @app/product test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/upload-artifact@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">product-dist</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">apps/product/dist/</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"增量构建优化\">增量构建优化</h3><p>Turborepo 的远程缓存避免重复构建未变更的包：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"// turbo.json&#10;{&#10;  &quot;pipeline&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;build&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;dependsOn&quot;: [&quot;^build&quot;],&#10;      &quot;outputs&quot;: [&quot;dist/**&quot;],&#10;      &quot;cache&quot;: true&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;test&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;dependsOn&quot;: [&quot;build&quot;],&#10;      &quot;cache&quot;: true&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// turbo.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"pipeline\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dependsOn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"outputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dist/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"cache\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"test\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dependsOn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"cache\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Rspack 的 5-10x 构建加速进一步压缩了 CI 时间。在 50+ 子应用的项目中，配合 Turborepo 远程缓存，平均 CI 时间从 12 分钟降至 2 分钟。</p>\n<h2 id=\"部署策略\">部署策略</h2><h3 id=\"mf-manifest-json-驱动的部署\">mf-manifest.json 驱动的部署</h3><p>MF 2.0 引入的 manifest 协议使部署与代码解耦：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"// https://product.example.com/mf-manifest.json&#10;{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;product&quot;,&#10;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.3.1&quot;,&#10;  &quot;metaData&quot;: { &quot;buildTime&quot;: &quot;2026-07-01T10:00:00Z&quot; },&#10;  &quot;exposes&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;./ProductList&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;assets&quot;: { &quot;js&quot;: [&quot;chunks/ProductList-a1b2c3.js&quot;] }&#10;    }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;shared&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;react&quot;: { &quot;version&quot;: &quot;19.1.0&quot;, &quot;singleton&quot;: true }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// https://product.example.com/mf-manifest.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"product\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2.3.1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"metaData\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"buildTime\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-07-01T10:00:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"exposes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"./ProductList\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"assets\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"js\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"chunks/ProductList-a1b2c3.js\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"shared\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"react\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"19.1.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"singleton\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>部署新版本 = 更新 manifest + 上传新的 chunk 文件。Host 下次加载时自动获取最新 manifest。</p>\n<h3 id=\"灰度发布\">灰度发布</h3><p>基于 manifest 的灰度策略：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 边缘 Worker 根据用户特征返回不同 manifest&#10;async function getManifest(request: Request): Promise&lt;string&gt; {&#10;  const userId = getUserId(request);&#10;  const isCanary = await isInCanaryGroup(userId);&#10;  return isCanary&#10;    ? &#39;https://product.example.com/mf-manifest-canary.json&#39;&#10;    : &#39;https://product.example.com/mf-manifest.json&#39;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 边缘 Worker 根据用户特征返回不同 manifest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getManifest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">request</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> userId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getUserId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(request);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> isCanary</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> isInCanaryGroup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(userId);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> isCanary</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    ?</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'https://product.example.com/mf-manifest-canary.json'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    :</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'https://product.example.com/mf-manifest.json'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"回滚机制\">回滚机制</h3><p>回滚 = 将 manifest 指针指回上一个版本的产物。由于旧版本的 chunk 文件仍保留在 CDN 上（content-hash 命名保证不覆盖），回滚是瞬时的、无构建的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"环境管理\">环境管理</h2><p>多环境（开发/预发/生产）通过 manifest URL 切换：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// Host 配置——环境感知&#10;const env = process.env.DEPLOY_ENV;&#10;const manifestBase = {&#10;  development: &#39;http://localhost:3001&#39;,&#10;  staging: &#39;https://staging.product.example.com&#39;,&#10;  production: &#39;https://product.example.com&#39;,&#10;}[env];&#10;&#10;new ModuleFederationPlugin({&#10;  remotes: {&#10;    product: `product@${manifestBase}/mf-manifest.json`,&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Host 配置——环境感知</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> env</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> process.env.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">DEPLOY_ENV</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> manifestBase</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  development: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'http://localhost:3001'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  staging: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://staging.product.example.com'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  production: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://product.example.com'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}[env];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ModuleFederationPlugin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  remotes: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    product: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`product@${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">manifestBase</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}/mf-manifest.json`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"preview-环境\">Preview 环境</h2><p>每个 PR 自动部署 Preview 环境是微前端的「杀手级」工程实践：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>PR 触发构建，产物上传到临时 CDN 路径</li>\n<li>生成临时 manifest URL</li>\n<li>在 PR 评论中提供 Preview 链接</li>\n<li>Shell 的 Preview 版本使用临时 manifest</li>\n<li>PR 合并后自动清理临时资源</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>独立构建 + 独立部署是微前端的核心约束</li>\n<li>monorepo 是多数团队的最优起点</li>\n<li>mf-manifest.json 是部署的核心枢纽：灰度/回滚/多环境都围绕它实现</li>\n<li>Turborepo 远程缓存 + Rspack 快速构建压缩 CI 时间</li>\n<li>PR Preview 环境显著提升多团队协作的评审效率</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 下一篇：<a href=\"testing-quality\">测试与质量保障</a> — 跨应用边界的测试策略</li>\n<li>跨 hub 参考：<a href=\"../build-tooling-bundlers/engineering/ci-build-perf\">构建工具 hub — CI 构建性能</a> — 构建流水线的通用优化策略</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"构建与部署流水线","id":"构建与部署流水线"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"仓库策略选择","id":"仓库策略选择"},{"level":2,"text":"构建流水线设计","id":"构建流水线设计"},{"level":3,"text":"独立构建原则","id":"独立构建原则"},{"level":3,"text":"增量构建优化","id":"增量构建优化"},{"level":2,"text":"部署策略","id":"部署策略"},{"level":3,"text":"mf-manifest.json 驱动的部署","id":"mf-manifest-json-驱动的部署"},{"level":3,"text":"灰度发布","id":"灰度发布"},{"level":3,"text":"回滚机制","id":"回滚机制"},{"level":2,"text":"环境管理","id":"环境管理"},{"level":2,"text":"Preview 环境","id":"preview-环境"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"共享依赖管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-micro-frontends/engineering/shared-dependencies"},"next":{"title":"测试与质量保障","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-micro-frontends/engineering/testing-quality"}}